  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d2a9460aae1c4420a415466d1db880f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 32
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dossamer.Dialogue.Schema.Cutscene
  Title: 3-2
  Exchanges:
  - Lines:
    - Text: Take a closer look at this test chamber, kid. You should spot something
        new.
      Guid:
        Value: abbe8cec-142c-4af6-9a2b-0d05db9c10d7
    - Text: We put some batteries there, so you'd be able to regain charge while
        on the move.
      Guid:
        Value: 7794f087-977b-4b54-8939-3551a7f8da83
    - Text: You don't need to do anything to pick them up really, the board should
        take care of it on its own, just get close enough to them and see how your
        energy goes up.
      Guid:
        Value: 389cc34a-944c-4b1b-b020-3863958c86e7
    - Text: That is all, engie out.
      Guid:
        Value: 30bfcca0-450c-4537-bebb-dd142582c0d8
    Speaker: The Engineer
    Guid:
      Value: 9f455cf9-0f50-4470-a12d-f492f56dc60a
  - Lines:
    - Text: Even though I don't think he's that much older than me, I still appreciate
        working with another non-robotic.
      Guid:
        Value: 09cde417-d29b-4779-b317-1fd91431a474
    - Text: No offense.
      Guid:
        Value: abf21034-e810-4bc4-8e7d-6db330c74bf2
    Speaker: The Janitor
    Guid:
      Value: c762750f-85ba-4edf-9f6c-336e9f755141
  Guid:
    Value: 1cc8f084-3e3a-4ca5-8b4c-9193f1a0685f
